{"4945010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Occult: Scarlet Elegy", "steam_appid": 4945010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Behind the veil of normalcy exists a group known simply as The Garden, a worldwide secret society tasked with protecting occult secrets from the masses. Into this harsh and secretive society are born Lily and her sister Yew, who have been infused with powerful ancient spirits since conception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/3d422770c0c883d2def7be5d1492dde1.avif?t=1787806589\" width=560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/99f96dc8fea5434915134cc1e72c280a.avif?t=1787806589\" width=662 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even during the scariest and hardest moments, friendship can bloom! Build relationships with your party members in stylish skits and beautiful, fully directed cutscenes during exploration and side quests to increase their effectiveness in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/8e24955d760e5eef56074de5f37d50eb.poster.avif?t=1787806589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/8e24955d760e5eef56074de5f37d50eb.webm?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/8e24955d760e5eef56074de5f37d50eb.mp4?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/63afb03ae0b8a39f0999185e34ea44db.poster.avif?t=1787806589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/63afb03ae0b8a39f0999185e34ea44db.webm?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/63afb03ae0b8a39f0999185e34ea44db.mp4?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/6c1ac085a46e1099577db31df39d321a.avif?t=1787806589\" width=946 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lily, the main character, is a healer with no offensive abilities who takes on the role of a reluctant leader in this turn-based RPG. Keep your friends alive, whatever the cost, by issuing orders that influence their stats during battle, granting them powerful buffs to ensure their survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/ca9c87dd3425af71748d63c596e5e41a.poster.avif?t=1787806589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/ca9c87dd3425af71748d63c596e5e41a.webm?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/ca9c87dd3425af71748d63c596e5e41a.mp4?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/d6e184e17604948e6bd616c3986fd30f.poster.avif?t=1787806589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/d6e184e17604948e6bd616c3986fd30f.webm?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/d6e184e17604948e6bd616c3986fd30f.mp4?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/fbdd15aa2b3acc3defa8f31ee576b6e9.avif?t=1787806589\" width=662 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore fully 3D-rendered locations in an old-school, grid-based dungeon crawler setting. Investigate  haunted schools, abandoned metro stations, and an otherworldly hospital wards, each of those labythinths containing treasures, traps and many enemies to battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/ae5557d11989af93d2de7f9ad3e48050.poster.avif?t=1787806589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/ae5557d11989af93d2de7f9ad3e48050.webm?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/ae5557d11989af93d2de7f9ad3e48050.mp4?t=1787806589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Behind the veil of normalcy exists a group known simply as The Garden, a worldwide secret society tasked with protecting occult secrets from the masses. Into this harsh and secretive society are born Lily and her sister Yew, who have been infused with powerful ancient spirits since conception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/3d422770c0c883d2def7be5d1492dde1.avif?t=1787806589\" width=560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/99f96dc8fea5434915134cc1e72c280a.avif?t=1787806589\" width=662 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even during the scariest and hardest moments, friendship can bloom! Build relationships with your party members in stylish skits and beautiful, fully directed cutscenes during exploration and side quests to increase their effectiveness in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4945010/extras/8e24955d760e5eef56074de5f37d50eb.poster.avif?t=1787806